      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "PreparingAssets loading assets is currently randomly taking a lot of time for large worlds, I've experienced a 60 seconds delay yesterday too while the world was fully downloaded.\n\n```\n\n2026.04.02 21:23:18 Debug      -  [Behaviour] Preparation has taken 50 seconds, progress is 0.9206573%, loader state is PreparingAssets\n\n2026.04.02 21:23:25 Debug      -  [AssetBundleDownloadManager] Download for world (707.0 MB) started 0 seconds and completed 58 seconds after queueing.\n\n2026.04.02 21:23:25 Debug      -  [AssetBundleDownloadManager] Average download speed: 13751222 bytes per second\n\n```\n\nThe loading screen staid frozen at 100% downloaded for ~50 seconds, until I went to check the logs what's wrong and why it's stuck there and I was loaded into the world before I finished reading the logs.\n\nIn ~10 hours, this only happened once.\n\n> Processor Type: Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-3770 CPU @ 3.40GHz\n\n@{69cf3ff8bcda4ee632041af0|full_name} Your computer doesn't meet VRChat's minimum system requirements and isn't supported.",
